      "Permission": {
        "value": "<table class=\"layouttemplate navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"margin:.25em;padding:.25em .5em;background-color:var(--background-color-base,#ffffff);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--background-color-disabled,#eeeeee)\" data-nosnippet=\"\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Dieser Text und viele andere auch sind ebenso in deutscher Sprache verfügbar. Um diese sehen zu können, wähle bitte auf dieser Webseite die Spracheinstellung „Deutsch“.\n</td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear:both;border:1px solid var(--background-color-disabled,#eeeeee);margin:.25em;padding:.25em .5em;background-color:var(--background-color-base,#ffffff);color:inherit;font-size:90%;\" class=\"searchaux\" data-nosnippet=\"\">\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HSSection_sign.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/HSSection_sign.svg/120px-HSSection_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/HSSection_sign.svg/250px-HSSection_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"156\" data-file-height=\"156\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cc_by-sa_(1).svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Cc_by-sa_%281%29.svg/120px-Cc_by-sa_%281%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Cc_by-sa_%281%29.svg/250px-Cc_by-sa_%281%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"42\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><div><b>I. Licence</b></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">This photograph is protected by copyright law. However, it may be used for free by anyone, provided it is used in accordance with the license <b>Creative Commons License <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed\">“Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International”</a></b> (CC BY-SA 4.0). These include, among other things, the naming of the author and the license, as well as the setting of a link to the license text or its complete imprint. The attribution should be done as follows:</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:0.5em; text-align:center;\"><i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:XRay\" title=\"User:XRay\">Dietmar Rabich</a> / <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Main_Page\" title=\"Main Page\">Wikimedia Commons</a> / <span class=\"plainlinks noprint\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:London,_Trafalgar_Square,_Nelson%27s_Column_--_2016_--_4853.jpg\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:London,_Trafalgar_Square,_Nelson%27s_Column_--_2016_--_4853.jpg\">“London, Trafalgar Square, Nelson's Column -- 2016 -- 4853”</a></